title: "RSSI Ordered Reachability: Synthetic Experiments A–F"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "HOHO"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible synthetic study of path-dependent state transitions under
  bounded local-update rules, including apparent/internal correction,
  independent-reference divergence, attractor escape, recapture, order
  effects, and admissible reachability.
keywords:
  - synthetic dynamical systems
  - ordered reachability
  - path dependence
  - local update rule
  - reproducible research

